slug\";s:6:\"social\";s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Social\";s:11:\"create_date\";s:19:\"2018-09-27 01:27:24\";s:13:\"modified_date\";s:19:\"2026-10-15 22:03:34\";s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:4:\"link\";s:43:\"https://thememylogin.com/extensions/social/\";s:9:\"permalink\";s:43:\"https://thememylogin.com/extensions/social/\";s:7:\"content\";s:917:\"<p>Skip the registration form. Social adds Google, Facebook, LinkedIn and X buttons to your login and registration forms, so visitors can sign in with an account they already have.</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Log in with Google, Facebook, LinkedIn or X <small>(requires pay-per-use API credits from X)</small></li>\n<li>Show buttons on the login form, the registration form, or both</li>\n<li>Buttons follow each provider\'s brand guidelines</li>\n<li>Drag providers into the order their buttons appear</li>\n<li>A first sign-in creates an account, with name and email filled in</li>\n<li>Returning users are matched to their existing account by email</li>\n<li>Google and LinkedIn emails must be verified before they\'re linked to an existing account</li>\n<li>Works across a multisite network, with one set of app credentials for every site</li>\n<li>Send emails on social sign-ups and logins with Notifications</li>\n</ul>\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:69:\"Let visitors log in or register with Google, Facebook, LinkedIn or X.\";s:9:\"thumbnail\";s:59:\"https://cdn.thememylogin.com/uploads/edd/2018/06/social.png\";s:8:\"category\";b:0;s:4:\"tags\";b:0;s:5:\"image\";s:189:\"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://cdn.thememylogin.com/uploads/edd/2018/06/social-150x150.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" />\";s:13:\"purchase_link\";s:3206:\"	<form id=\"edd_purchase_1027\" class=\"edd_download_purchase_form edd_purchase_1027\" method=\"post\">\n\n			<div class=\"edd_price_options edd_single_mode\" >\n		<ul>\n			<li id=\"edd_price_option_1027_singlesite\"><label for=\"edd_price_o