gin page and brought back afterward</li>\n<li>Restricted posts are hidden from archives and your blog page</li>\n<li>Show menu items and widgets to everyone, logged-in users, guests, or chosen roles</li>\n<li><code>&#91;tml-require-role&#93;</code> and <code>&#91;tml-require-user&#93;</code> show content to specific roles or users, with <code>&#91;else&#93;</code> content for everyone else</li>\n</ul>\";s:7:\"excerpt\";s:108:\"Limit posts, pages, menus and widgets to logged-in users or specific roles, or make your whole site private.\";s:9:\"thumbnail\";s:65:\"https://cdn.thememylogin.com/uploads/edd/2018/06/restrictions.png\";s:8:\"category\";b:0;s:4:\"tags\";b:0;s:5:\"image\";s:195:\"<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://cdn.thememylogin.com/uploads/edd/2018/06/restrictions-150x150.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" />\";s:13:\"purchase_link\";s:3188:\"	<form id=\"edd_purchase_103\" class=\"edd_download_purchase_form edd_purchase_103\" method=\"post\">\n\n			<div class=\"edd_price_options edd_single_mode\" >\n		<ul>\n			<li id=\"edd_price_option_103_singlesite\"><label for=\"edd_price_option_103_1\"><input type=\"radio\"  checked=\'checked\' name=\"edd_options[price_id][]\" id=\"edd_price_option_103_1\" class=\"edd_price_option_103\" value=\"1\" data-price=\"29.00\"/>&nbsp;<span class=\"edd_price_option_name\">Single Site</span><span class=\"edd_price_option_sep\">&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"edd_price_option_price\">&#36;29.00</span></label></li><li id=\"edd_price_option_103_2-5sites\"><label for=\"edd_price_option_103_2\"><input type=\"radio\"  name=\"edd_options[price_id][]\" id=\"edd_price_option_103_2\" class=\"edd_price_option_103\" value=\"2\" data-price=\"49.00\"/>&nbsp;<span class=\"edd_price_option_name\">2-5 Sites</span><span class=\"edd_price_option_sep\">&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"edd_price_option_price\">&#36;49.00</span></label></li><li id=\"edd_price_opt